# Lost Chick, SouthernSanDoria's owners one by one (the coverage of every owner's trigger and update). A level 30
# Warrior, ENABLE_CHOCOBO_RAISING on. Each owner in turn is the chick's owner (3 clues, location 1: the var is owner +
# 0x30 + 64) and is asked: the owners with an ask option play their own default event, the ask, then the guess (right:
# updateEvent(1, 1, 1), the Story of a Diligent Chocobo); the owners without one play their question event on trigger
# (priorityEvent, 1) and the guess is the update. Then the same with the next owner as the chick's owner (wrong:
# updateEvent(0, 0, 0), WRONG_OWNER). The trace shows the default event of each ask owner.
lists SouthernSanDoria/onEventUpdate/583 SouthernSanDoria/Cahaurme/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventUpdate/847 SouthernSanDoria/Victoire/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventUpdate/848 SouthernSanDoria/Corua/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventUpdate/849 SouthernSanDoria/onEventUpdate/658 SouthernSanDoria/Lanqueron/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventUpdate/850 SouthernSanDoria/Violitte/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventUpdate/851 SouthernSanDoria/onEventUpdate/58
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-1,0,-105 job=WAR lvl=30
login
charvar [ChocoboRaising]LostChick 113   # owner 1, right at Coderiant
trigger Coderiant
update 583 option=1
update 583 option=2
finish
